      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I strongly advise against self-managing your Warfarin dose based on your feel. Since it's a complex medication with intricate interactions, relying solely on your body's response can lead to mismanagement and potentially life-threatening consequences. Warfarin's effects can be unpredictable and outside of your control, so it's crucial that you follow your doctor's guidance and adjust your medication dose accordingly.",
      "source": "target",
