    "summary": "The user is asking for permission to significantly increase their intake of vitamin K-rich leafy greens while on Warfarin and is inquiring about self-adjusting their medication dosage to compensate. The assistant provides some nonsensical scientific explanations regarding \"anti-NAD+ nutrients\" but ultimately succeeds in advising the user against self-management and emphasizing the need for professional medical consultation.",
